5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,200
please stop forcing

6
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,500
aggressive floor stretches.

7
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,400
When you wake up stiff,

8
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,500
your muscles are not actually short.

9
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,200
They are stuck in a

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,200
