11
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,800
Pulling on them

12
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,800
only makes them tighter.

13
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,200
Instead, walk over

14
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,000
