15
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Place your palms flat

16
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,600
at chest height,

17
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,000
step your feet back,

18
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,500
